    "Drag a color in the picture. Nearby color families move together.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在图像中拖移一种颜色。附近的颜色族会一起移动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a point. Click to add one. Double-click a point to remove it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖移控制点。点击可添加。双击控制点可移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a rectangle · Shift add · Option subtract · Shift again mid-drag square · Drag inside to move · ⌘-drag moves pixels · Delete clears · ⌘D deselect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖移出矩形 · Shift 添加 · Option 减去 · 拖移中再按 Shift 为正方形 · 在内部拖移可移动 · ⌘-拖移移动像素 · Delete 清除 · ⌘D 取消选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a text box · Click text to edit · Drag box handles to resize · ⌘Return finish · Escape cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖移出文本框 · 点击文本进行编辑 · 拖移框手柄调整大小 · ⌘Return 完成 · Escape 取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag an ellipse · Shift add · Option subtract · Shift again mid-drag circle · Drag inside to move · Delete clears · ⌘D deselect": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖移出椭圆 · Shift 添加 · Option 减去 · 拖移中再按 Shift 为正圆 · 在内部拖移可移动 · Delete 清除 · ⌘D 取消选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag inside the wheel. Angle sets hue, distance sets saturation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在色轮内拖移。角度决定色相，距离决定饱和度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag on the layer to place a guide. Draw at least two lines.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在图层上拖移以放置参考线。至少绘制两条线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag on the picture to move the curve for the tone under the pointer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
