    "Hide Selection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏选区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide the background behind a layer mask, keeping the foreground subjects. The pixels stay, so the background can be painted back at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏图层蒙版背后的背景，保留前景主体。像素仍然保留，因此随时可以绘制回背景。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide the gamut warning": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏色域警告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High quality": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高品质"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Clipping Indicator": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光修剪指示器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Priority": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光优先"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Priority protects bright edges. Color Priority also reduces color. Paint Overlay covers the edges evenly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光优先保护明亮边缘；颜色优先还会减少颜色；绘画覆盖则均匀地覆盖边缘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Recovery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlights": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Histogram": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直方图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold Shift to add or Option to subtract for one outline": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住 Shift 添加或按住 Option 减去，可进行一次描边"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Horizontal Centers": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "水平中心"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Horizontal Spacing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "水平间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Horizontal ruler": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "水平标尺"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How big the light is": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光源的大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to flare; near 100, only the biggest, brightest spots": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线产生耀斑所需的亮度；接近 100 时只有最大最亮的光点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to sparkle; near 100, only the biggest, brightest spots": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光点需要多亮才会闪耀；接近 100 时，只有最大最亮的光点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright the beams are": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光束的亮度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright the lines are where the picture is black, so they show even over black": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图像为黑处线条的亮度，使其在黑底上也可见"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How brightly lights open into discs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线展开成圆盘的明亮程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far a color may be from the picked ones and still be selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色与所选取颜色的最大差距，在此范围内仍会被选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the copies are": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "副本之间的距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the screen's lines are": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕线条之间的距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far each color channel (0–255) can differ from the clicked color and still be selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个颜色通道（0–255）与所点击颜色的最大差距，在此范围内仍会被选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far from each edge the sharpening reaches, in pixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锐化从每条边缘向内延伸的距离，以像素为单位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far from the light the beams reach": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光束从光源向外照射的距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in brightness the adjustment reaches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在明度上达到的范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in hue the adjustment reaches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在色相上达到的范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in saturation the adjustment reaches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在饱和度上达到的范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far into the scene the haze begins: low reaches up to the camera, high leaves all but the farthest parts clear": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "雾气在场景中开始的深度：低值一直延伸到镜头前，高值只保留最远部分之外的区域清晰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far out of focus: the size of each disc": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "失焦程度：每个圆盘的大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the blur softens, in pixels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模糊柔化的距离，以像素为单位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the brightness is smoothed before it displaces the lines, from sharp ridges to rounded hills": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮度在推移线条前的平滑程度，从锐利山脊到圆润丘陵"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the colors spread apart, red one way and blue the other": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色分开的距离，红色向一边、蓝色向另一边"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the lens's coatings turn each streak blue along its length; none keeps the light's own color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "镜头镀膜使每条条纹沿长度变蓝的程度；为 0 时保持光线本身的颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the light spreads": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线扩散的距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the light wraps around the subject's edges": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线环绕主体边缘的程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the spikes reach": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "星芒伸展的距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the streaks reach across the picture": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "条纹横跨图像的距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How fine the detail it sharpens: small for crisp texture, larger for a punchier look": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锐化细节的精细程度：小值纹理清晰，大值观感更有冲击力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long each frame shows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每帧显示的时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many pixels to expand, contract or feather the selection by": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩展、收缩或羽化选区的像素数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many spikes each light has, as the lens's aperture blades make them": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个光点的星芒数量，如镜头光圈叶片所形成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many times the picture echoes, each fainter": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图像重影的次数，每次更淡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much colored speckle is smoothed into the colors around it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "彩色斑点融入周围颜色的平滑程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much fine texture and edges are kept while the grain is smoothed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "平滑颗粒时保留精细纹理与边缘的程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much grain is smoothed from the picture's brightness": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从画面亮度中平滑颗粒的程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much light scatters: a soft halo around bright areas, and gently lifted shadows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线散射的程度：亮区周围的柔和光晕，以及轻微提亮的阴影"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个像素的误差向相邻像素扩散的程度。越小色块越平"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the gap a bright line fills; dimmer parts draw it thinner": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮线填充间隙的程度；较暗的部分线条更细"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile distortion correction is applied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用配置文件畸变校正的程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile vignetting correction is applied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用配置文件暗角校正的程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much the beams break up into separate shafts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光束分离成独立光柱的程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much the curve also changes color strength. Zero matches Photoshop; lower keeps it to brightness, higher adds more color.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "曲线同时改变颜色强度的程度。零与 Photoshop 一致；较低则只影响明度，较高则增加更多颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How strongly edges and fine detail are brought out": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "边缘与精细细节的突出程度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the light ends on the inside: low feathers it off softly from the edge, high holds it bright and ends it crisply": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线在内侧的收尾方式：低值从边缘柔和羽化，高值保持明亮并清晰收尾"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the line's ends, and each of its dashes and dots, are finished": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线条端点以及每个划段和点的收尾方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How thick the air is: haze lit by the light, thinner in front of the subject": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空气的浓厚程度：被光照亮的雾气，主体前方较薄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相"
          }
        }
