    "Keep the 16-bit layers' full precision, in a file about twice the size": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留 16 位图层的完整精度，文件大小约为两倍"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the source moving with the brush between strokes; off starts every stroke at the source point": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让源点在笔画之间随画笔移动；关闭时每笔都从源点开始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the subject clear of the haze; off, it's hazed by its own distance, so a figure far off is misted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让主体不受雾气影响；关闭时主体按自身距离受雾，远处的人物会被雾气笼罩"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep transparent areas": {
