    "Split Channels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分离通道"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split each copy's red and blue apart, as glass does; 0 keeps the copies crisp": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "像玻璃一样把每个副本的红色与蓝色分离；0 保持副本清晰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split the layer's original channels into four grayscale layers, Red, Green, Blue and Alpha, for Export As › Channel Pack. Color under fully transparent pixels can't be recovered": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将图层的原始通道拆分为红、绿、蓝和 Alpha 四个灰度图层，用于“导出为 › 通道包”。完全透明像素下的颜色无法恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
