    "TIFF": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TIFF"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tab": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tab"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Targeted Adjustment": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标调整"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Targeted adjustment": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标调整"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Targeted adjustment: drag on the image to change that color's saturation, or its hue with Command held": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标调整：在图像上拖移以改变该颜色的饱和度，按住 Command 则改变其色相"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperature": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色温"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temporary Hand tool (hold)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "临时抓手工具（按住）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Editing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Size": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本字段保留标准 macOS 编辑键。对话框共用上方的“应用/取消”设置。数字字段使用上/下方向键，按住 Shift 步进更大。标准 macOS 命令包括 ⌘Q 退出和 ⌃⌘F 全屏。快捷键编辑器本身在非录制状态下总是用 Return 存储、Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text · Double-click to edit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本 · 双击编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text-editing shortcuts need Command, Option, or Control so they do not replace normal typing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本编辑快捷键需要 Command、Option 或 Control，以免影响正常输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Texture": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "纹理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That profile isn’t a CMYK output profile.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该配置文件不是 CMYK 输出配置文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That selection is too detailed to outline. Try a different Tolerance, or turn on Contiguous.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该选区过于细致，无法描边。请尝试其他“容差”，或打开“连续”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That shape is too large. A shape can cover up to %lld megapixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该形状过大。一个形状最多可覆盖 %lld 兆像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That text box exceeds the %@-pixel or %lld-megapixel limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本框超过 %@ 像素或 %lld 百万像素的上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 2012 response. Calibration reaches most of the strength used by Version 6.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2012 年的响应。校准可达到版本 6 的大部分强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop file could not be read. It may be damaged or incomplete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取该 Photoshop 文件。它可能已损坏或不完整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop stroke isn’t supported on shape layers and was omitted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "形状图层不支持该 Photoshop 描边，已省略。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop text warp was omitted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已省略该 Photoshop 文字变形。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The aperture's shape: round wide open, a hexagon of blades, an anamorphic oval, or a cat's eye toward the edges": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光圈形状：全开时的圆形、叶片组成的六边形、变形镜头椭圆，或靠边缘的猫眼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The blur where the line ends, and past it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线条末端及其之后的模糊"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The blur where the line starts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线条起点的模糊"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brush trails the pointer on a string this long, so a shaky hand still draws a smooth line": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画笔以这么长的“绳索”跟随指针，手抖也能画出平滑的线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The canvas could not be rendered. Try a smaller canvas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法渲染画布。请尝试更小的画布。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The characters to draw with, in any order: each spot gets the one whose ink best matches its tone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于绘制的字符，顺序不限：每个位置使用油墨最匹配其色调的字符"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copied GIFs exceed this project’s animation memory limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拷贝的 GIF 超出了此项目的动画内存限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copied layers exceed this project’s %lld-megapixel limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拷贝的图层超出了此项目 %lld 兆像素的限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The font “%@” isn’t installed, so the text was drawn with the system font.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字体“%@”未安装，因此文本以系统字体绘制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The height of each line of characters": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行字符的高度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image could not be encoded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法编码该图像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image could not be read. It may be damaged or unavailable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取该图像。它可能已损坏或不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layer mask couldn’t be converted to 8-bit grayscale and was skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图层蒙版无法转换为 8 位灰度，已跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layer mask is turned off. Shift-click its thumbnail to turn it on, then paint.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图层蒙版已关闭。Shift-点击其缩略图可将其打开，然后绘制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The object mask could not be rendered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法渲染对象蒙版。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected animation timeline is missing or invalid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选的动画时间线缺失或无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The smart object was rasterized. Linked contents can’t be edited.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能对象已栅格化。链接的内容无法编辑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trimmed image dimensions are invalid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "修剪后的图像尺寸无效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There isn’t enough memory to make that selection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有足够的内存来进行该选择。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These layers supply live masks": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些图层提供实时蒙版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thickness": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "厚度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Layer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此图层"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This PDF is password-protected. Save an unlocked copy, then import that.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 PDF 受密码保护。请另存为未加密的副本后再导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Photoshop file uses a format version Compositor can’t read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Photoshop 文件使用了 Compositor 无法读取的格式版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Photoshop file uses a layer compression method that isn’t supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Photoshop 文件使用了不支持的图层压缩方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Photoshop layer type isn’t supported and was imported as pixels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持此 Photoshop 图层类型，已作为像素导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This adjustment type isn’t supported and was skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持此调整类型，已跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This animation has more than %@ frames, which exceeds the current timeline limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此动画有超过 %@ 帧，超出了当前时间线限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This clipping mask’s base isn’t supported, so clipping was skipped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持此剪贴蒙版的基底，已跳过剪贴。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file has no lens profile": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件没有镜头配置文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This import exceeds the current %lld-megapixel document budget or %@-pixel side limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此导入超出了当前 %lld 兆像素的文档预算或每边 %@ 像素的限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is not a valid Compositor project, or its metadata is damaged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是有效的 Compositor 项目，或其元数据已损坏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This layer supplies a live mask": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此图层提供实时蒙版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This project exceeds the supported canvas, layer, file-size, or %lld-megapixel document limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此项目超出了支持的画布、图层、文件大小或 %lld 兆像素的文档限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This project uses format version %lld. This app supports versions 1–%lld and 27.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此项目使用格式版本 %lld。本应用支持版本 1–%lld 和 27。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three-Way": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三向"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three-Way shows shadows, midtones, and highlights. The other choices show one wheel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三向显示阴影、中间调和高光色轮。其他选项只显示一个色轮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Threshold": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "阈值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tint": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色调"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle Clipping Mask": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换剪贴蒙版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle Fullscreen": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换全屏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle Fullscreen: the canvas alone on black (Esc also leaves)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换全屏：黑场上只显示画布（Esc 也可退出）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle Levels preview": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切换色阶预览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tolerance": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "容差"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tonal Contrast": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色调对比"
          }
